abstract: >-
  Reproducible code and prefecture-level aggregated data (N = 47) for an
  ecological study linking habitable-area-weighted terrain slope to hip,
  humerus, and forearm fracture surgery rates in Japan, using the 10th NDB
  Open Data, 2020 census covariates, and GSI terrain derivatives.
